{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NO MORE FURRIES</strong> is a <strong>SINGLEPLAYER ROUND-BASED SURVIVAL SHOOTER</strong>. Your mission is to survive or become one with the <strong>WEREWOLVES</strong> that plague the now conquered world. Choose from a variety of maps that span over a Werewolf Ruled world.\u00a0</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.poster.avif?t=1771613133\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.webm?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/0d784e22f3fe3d37a1878324b5325c15.mp4?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>CAN YOU SURVIVE?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Society is devastated by an unknown malicious entity as hordes of werewolves hunt. You must fight and survive the endless waves while using a diverse arsenal of weapons that can be collected in each map to give you a fighting chance. Discover new maps that feature unique elements to the world that werewolves have now conquered.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.poster.avif?t=1771613133\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.webm?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/5db7d0fb9a51c9f074c9928b6cb9929a.mp4?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>POWERFUL UPGRADES</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Discover new and powerful combinations to help you take out this never ending threat. Upgrade weapons to give you an advantage in the fray or choose to upgrade yourself with a tasty treat with some surprising effects. Though be careful, as with each passing wave your enemy grows stronger as well. Some upgrades may prove more useful than others.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.poster.avif?t=1771613133\" width=616 height=352 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.webm?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/extras/492f985cba7e41ce69f4a85b998f9e00.mp4?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LET'S GET HAIRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is designed to create a unique atmosphere of dread and curiosity. Discover what went wrong and where we are going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot them, knife them, or go the fun route and blow them to pieces making that furry little monster that was sneaking up behind you think twice about taking a bite out of your caboose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will you last...and what will you discover?</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"GEALACH LUCKY DUCK","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3987570/5ed7e2d634ed0