4?t=1771613133\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>LET'S GET HAIRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each map is designed to create a unique atmosphere of dread and curiosity. Discover what went wrong and where we are going.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shoot them, knife them, or go the fun route and blow them to pieces making that furry little monster that was sneaking up behind you think twice about taking a bite out of your caboose. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How long will you last...and what will you discover?</p>","developers":["Belfrost Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3987570/55cb859c7ce3bca7707f2cbd65671c58f38ef550/header.jpg?t=1771613133","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"No More Furries features crude humor, violence, and silly situations or dialogue. We do not condone violence, language or acts towards anyone or anything outside of the game. If you are suffering from physical or mental health especially regarding acts of violence, language, or actions we urge you to seek medical attention. Any depictions or scenarios in our game that resemble anything outside of it are purely coincidental and should not be taken literally. By playing or purchasing our game you acknowledge the aforementioned ","linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987570/1739504651/99dabda74ed3b08749ed1b7cdc80630b57c30f65/1757037124/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758051511","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987570/1739504651/99dabda74ed3b08749ed1b7cdc80630b57c30f65/1757037124/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758051511","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3987570/1739504651/99dabda74ed3b08749ed1b7cdc80630b57c30f65/17